OL,3,GNEWSAHospital ordered to improve
OL,4,Aemergency services
OL,5,
OL,6,FA hospital has been ordered to improve
OL,7,Fits urgent and emergency services after
OL,8,Finspectors raised serious safety
OL,9,Fconcerns.
OL,11,FThe Care Quality Commission (CQC)
OL,12,Fdowngraded the safety rating of A&E at
OL,13,Fthe Queen Elizabeth the Queen Mother
OL,14,FHospital to inadequate.
OL,16,FInspectors found patients being cared
OL,17,Ffor in corridors and some waiting more
OL,18,Fthan 72 hours for a bed.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,323,320,200,140,0,100
