OL,3,GNEWSAHospital ordered to improve
OL,4,Aemergency services
OL,5,
OL,6,FDr Des Holden, acting chief executive
OL,7,Fof East Kent Hospitals NHS Foundation
OL,8,FTrust (EKHFT), said care seen by
OL,9,Finspectors was "unacceptable for
OL,10,Fpatients and staff" but said
OL,11,F"significant changes" had since been
OL,12,Fmade, which were reflected in a later
OL,13,Finspection in May.
